<title>THAILAND: Siam City Cement Q3 net rises.</title>
<headline>Siam City Cement Q3 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Audited financial results for the first nine months ending Septemer 30, 1996.</p>
<p>		   (in millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>					  Third quarter</p>
<p>				   1996			1995</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)		 1.60     vs	     1.04</p>
<p>    Net			187.00     vs	   121.65</p>
<p>					   Nine months</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)		 6.98     vs	    11.46</p>
<p>    Net			817.45     vs	 1,341.15</p>
<p>NOTE: Siam City Cement Plc is Thailand's second-largest cement company.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom 662-652-0642</p>
</text>
